  storytelling_past: 'Write a short story (6-8 sentences) about a day you remember. Open with "Un dia" or "Na kel tenpu", use -ba forms for what you used to do (N ta …ba), sequence it with "Primeru… dipos di kel… finalmenti", and end with how you felt.',
